From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rezoss <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Enable messaging content capture SmartReply fallbacks

Allow Samsung Messages, WhatsApp, and Telegram through SmartReply policy, provide fallback
app-view metadata, debounce parsing after conversation view/text events,
synchronously register and directly dispatch SmartReply capture, bootstrap
missing chat session state, recover uncached incoming messages, infer
chat message direction when fallback app-view metadata lacks thread geometry,
force the chat startSmartReply enabled gate, and bypass the chat recall
policy blocklist for test builds. Force chat SmartReply availability at the
resolver gate for Samsung Messages, WhatsApp, and Telegram so downstream model failures are
visible during testing, then skip the recall/action enrichment phase for those
chat packages so reply generation can proceed when recall stalls. Force the
post-recall reply and keyboard-visible gates for chat packages while testing.

---
